{#- The Inbox link of every surface (docs/features/navigation INB-02/INB-01, README §4.4 / D3): the top bars and the
    Menu's Inbox row include (or embed) it, never copy it. No inbox route of its own (R13): the href is the tab holding
    the unread items (InboxBadgeParts::target()), the accessible name says what is new ("Inbox, 2 new messages").
    A realtime push changes both in the browser (assets/inbox_badge.js) from the data attributes rendered here - the
    page's own locale; the stream itself carries numbers only. Those strings ride on the page's first Inbox link only
    (inbox_link_strings(): the top bar's; the Menu's row reads them there - the chrome's weight, README §4.12).
    Params: nav = data-nav (required); class = the link's classes; surface = adds inbox-link--<surface>;
    label = visible label text (none by default); badge_part = total (default) | for_you | messages; badge_class;
    parts = InboxBadgeParts (default inbox_badge()); current = true marks the current page's link (aria-current, the
    Menu's Inbox row - MENU-01); press = the pressed-state marker (GEST-04: 'fixed' in a bar, '' in the Menu; none by
    default). Renders nothing for guests.
    Embed it and override block `content` for a surface's own icon and badge markup (the badge stays an include of
    inbox/_badge.html.twig with `parts`). The top-bar tool ids (data-bar-action + data-bar-count, NAV-14 (d)) ride on
    the top bar's link only - one per page (QA-04 R11); the Menu's Inbox row is a row, not a tool. -#}
{%- set parts = parts ?? inbox_badge() -%}
{%- if parts is not null -%}
    {%- set inbox_target = parts.target() -%}
    <a href="{{ path(inbox_target.route, inbox_target.params) }}"
       class="inbox-link{{ (surface ?? '') is not empty ? ' inbox-link--' ~ surface }}{{ (class ?? '') is not empty ? ' ' ~ class }}"
       rel="nofollow"
       data-inbox-link
       data-nav="{{ nav }}"
       {%- if (press ?? null) is not null %} data-press{% if press != '' %}="{{ press }}"{% endif %}{% endif %}
       {%- if current ?? false %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}
       {%- if (surface ?? '') == 'topbar' %}
       data-bar-action="{{ bar_action('inbox') }}"
       data-bar-count="{{ parts.total() }}"
       {%- endif %}
       aria-label="{{ ('inbox.badge.name.' ~ parts.labelKind())|trans({'%count%': parts.labelCount()}) }}"
       {%- if inbox_link_strings() %}
       data-inbox-hrefs={{ {for_you: path('notifications'), messages: path('conversations_list'), requests: path('conversations_list', {tab: 'requests'})}|json_attribute }}
       data-inbox-labels={{ {none: browser_translation('inbox.badge.name.none'), messages: browser_translation('inbox.badge.name.messages'), for_you: browser_translation('inbox.badge.name.for_you'), mixed: browser_translation('inbox.badge.name.mixed')}|json_attribute }}
       {%- endif %}>
        {%- block content -%}
            <i class="bi bi-inbox" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            {{ include('inbox/_badge.html.twig', {part: badge_part ?? 'total', parts: parts, class: badge_class ?? ''}) }}
            {%- if (label ?? '') is not empty %} <span class="inbox-link-label">{{ label }}</span>{% endif -%}
        {%- endblock -%}
    </a>
{%- endif -%}
